# Frontend: GNOME, for desktop x86_64/arm64 machines. PLACEHOLDER.
#
# Buildroot has no GNOME session packages: no gnome-shell, no mutter, no
# gnome-session, no gdm - only the GTK libraries. Shipping this frontend
# means packaging that stack (mutter alone drags gsettings/gjs/
# gnome-settings-daemon) in external/, or rethinking the base (a GNOME
# desktop may be better served by a distro image than by Buildroot).
#
# Until then this fragment deliberately sets nothing: a board including it
# fails loudly at the review stage rather than half-building a desktop.
# The default EmulationStation/sway frontend stays in effect.
